<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54293" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-κρούω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knock</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐς τρύπημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					10.61
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make narrow incisions</i> or '<i>stabbings</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Medic.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>beat copper pans</i>, etc., in order to entice bees, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				843e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in Archit.
			perh., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακρούω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.4255.14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
